# No API key needed! This project runs on a local model via Ollama.
#
# One-time setup:
#   1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.com/download
#   2. Pull a model:   ollama pull llama3.1:8b
#   3. Ollama runs automatically as a background service after install
#      (or start it manually with `ollama serve`)
#
# Optional overrides - uncomment if you want a different model or host:
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1:8b
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
